  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Medicines for Malaria Venture (MMV) Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Global Health (GH)):  Funds will support the upstream development of malaria medicines.  The Medicines for Malaria will support research studies to evaluate the safety and efficacy of promising antimalarial treatments, including the development and regulatory authority approval of compounds or regimens in clinical phase development. The goal is to contribute to the development of non-artemisinin based therapies to treat drug-resistant malaria and products for preventive and treatment therapies for infants, children, and pregnant women, and medicines to help accelerate toward elimination.</narrative>
  </description>
